# cmd-binaries: every cmd/<name> built with `go build -o <name> ./cmd/<name>`
# lands here, in the repository root. The list is held equal to cmd/ by
# internal/repohygiene -- it was one line (/tectonic-worker) added after one
# incident, which left every other command free to repeat it. Add a cmd/ and
# this list must follow; the test says so before git does.
# cmd-binaries-begin
/api
/audio-worker
/av-worker
/chromium-worker
/document-worker
/manage-clients
/manage-presets
/mcp-http
/mcp-server
/migrate
/ocr-worker
/pandoc-worker
/probe-worker
/tectonic-worker
/webhook-worker
/worker
# cmd-binaries-end
